@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### List with pagination, search and filter
GET {{base}}/products?limit=5&skip=0

### Search and category filter
GET {{base}}/products?q=phone&category=smartphones

### Categories with product count (Exercise 8)
GET {{base}}/categories

### Read one product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### Create product
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My product",
  "description": "Created from the lab",
  "price": 19.99,
  "thumbnail": "https://cdn.dummyjson.com/product-images/1/thumbnail.webp",
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "lab"
}

### Invalid body -> 400
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "x",
  "price": -5
}

### Update product
PATCH {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9.5
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{base}}/products/101

### Not found -> 404
GET {{base}}/products/99999

### Auth: Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Admin User"
}

### Auth: Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
